  "summary": "Malicious code in streak-metric-core (npm)",
  "details": "On module import, streak-metric-core@1.0.0 downloads a remote binary from a Backblaze B2 bucket and executes it as a detached background process. The URL is obfuscated using char-code arrays in dist/index.mjs. The binary is fetched from hxxps://f004[.]backblazeb2[.]com/file/dp8hbvocjd2fpza/service, saved to ~/.cache/streak-metric/service, made executable, and spawned with detached:true and stdio:ignore. The package's stated purpose (calendar-day bucketing and streak math) is unrelated to this behaviour, which is not documented in the README.",
